    description: Some("Short-Order Sam works a burger line under a performance rating that starts at 50 and ends the game at zero. In the assembly room you catch the condiments the dispenser flings out, matching the colour-coded orders on the board and swatting away the wrong ones; in the wrapping room each finished burger has to go down the chute of its own colour."),
